      "Fuel Distributor Plunger Seizure: If the vehicle sits for extended periods or is run on poor-quality fuel, the central plunger inside the fuel distributor can rust and seize completely. This completely disables the mechanical fuel injection system, preventing the engine from running at all. Rebuilding a seized Bosch fuel distributor requires absolute precision and is incredibly expensive.",
