    "maxPowerStockInternals": "650+ hp. The internal forged connecting rods, forged AMG crankshaft, and reinforced aluminum block are heavily over-engineered. The block handles massive supercharger overdrive pulleys and larger throttle bodies effortlessly on completely stock internals.",
