      "Water-to-Air Intercooler Pump Failure: The system utilizes an electric charge cooler pump to circulate coolant through the intercoolers. If this pump dies unnoticed, intake air temperatures skyrocket, causing severe pre-ignition detonation that can damage the pistons.",
