    "timingType": "Double-roller chain (Duplex). The OM606 utilizes a massively over-engineered duplex timing chain that is practically immortal, easily capable of outlasting the engine block itself. Timing chain failure on this specific architecture is virtually unheard of under routine fleet applications.",
    "injectionType": "Indirect Injection (IDI) via pre-combustion chambers. It uses a custom-detuned Bosch EDC electronic inline injection pump calibrated specifically to lower thermal loads and maximize torque delivery efficiency at low rotational speeds for commercial use.",
    "engineLifespan": "500 000 - 1 000 000+ km. Mechanically, this fleet-restricted block operates under exceptionally low thermal and mechanical stress levels. It trades top-end horsepower figures for absolute, heavy-duty commercial longevity in field operations.",
