      "blockDesign": "90-degree V8 closed-deck aluminum block. This extremely rigid architecture is identical to that used by AMG. It features advanced NANOSLIDE twin-wire arc-sprayed cylinder linings, providing an incredibly hard, mirror-like finish that drastically reduces piston friction compared to traditional iron liners while massively increasing thermal conductivity.",
