      "blockDesign": "90-degree V8 closed-deck aluminum block. Handcrafted in Affalterbach under the 'One Man, One Engine' philosophy. It features advanced NANOSLIDE twin-wire arc-sprayed cylinder linings, providing an incredibly hard, mirror-like finish that drastically reduces piston friction while massively increasing thermal conductivity.",
