      "Limp Mode Paralysis: Any failure of the M55 swirl motor, EGR valve sticking, or exhaust pressure sensor failure will instantly trigger Limp Mode, making the heavy SUV dangerously slow on the highway.",
      "Catastrophic Engine Seizure (Black Death): If the injector blow-by leakage is ignored, the escaping superheated combustion gases act like a cutting torch against the aluminum injector seats, destroying the cylinder head.",
