    "turboType": "Twin-Turbochargers (BiTurbo). Utilizes two compact turbochargers mounted on the exterior exhaust manifolds. They provide incredible, lag-free torque that peaks at just 1600 RPM. However, the internal wastegate actuator linkages are prone to wear, causing a rattling noise and eventual underboost conditions.",
