    "euroStandard": "Euro 5 / Euro 6",
    "maxPowerStockInternals": "800+ hp. The forged connecting rods, forged AMG crankshaft, and closed-deck block are brutally strong. The block handles massive aftermarket boost effortlessly, with limits dictated entirely by the transmission clutch capacity and extreme thermal heat soak.",
