      "Fuel Filter Housing Leak: The plastic fuel filter housing is prone to cracking and leaking raw diesel fuel over the top of the engine.",
      "Dual-Mass Flywheel Wear: Exclusive to this manual-transmission model, the dual-mass flywheel will degrade over 150,000 km, causing severe idle vibration and clutch judder."
