    "turboType": "Single Variable Geometry Turbocharger (VTG). Unlike the larger twin-turbo variants of the OM651, this 170 hp version relies on a single, highly responsive VTG turbo. Reliable, but prone to heat soak and DPF backpressure issues if driven exclusively in the city.",
    "ecuType": "Delphi engine management unit. A highly complex ECU managing strict Euro 5 emissions. It represents the unrestricted hardware potential of the 2.1L block for the early MFA platform, offering excellent throttle response and massive tuning headroom.",
