    "injectionType": "Direct Injection (CGI) operating at up to 250 bar via central 6-hole injectors. Integrated with a 48V Belt-Driven Starter-Generator (RSG) system. This setup provides seamless start-stop operation and EQ Boost, but direct injection inherently guarantees intake valve carbon buildup over high mileages.",
    "engineLifespan": "200 000 - 300 000+ km. The core aluminum block (co-developed with Renault/Nissan) is incredibly durable. However, the true lifespan is heavily dependent on the longevity of the complex 48V electrical architecture, GPF (Gasoline Particulate Filter) maintenance, and strict 10,000 km oil changes.",
