    "timingType": "Simplex timing chain. The M260 is the direct successor to the M270. Mercedes reinforced the timing chain architecture and Variable Valve Timing (VVT) phasers, making them significantly more reliable than the previous generation. However, strict adherence to low-ash oil change intervals is mandatory to prevent premature guide wear.",
