    "euroStandard": "Euro 6d",
    "maxPowerStockInternals": "400+ hp. The internal rotating assembly handles Stage 1 and Stage 2 tuning effortlessly. The restrictive GPF filter, the thermal limits of the cylinder head, and the 8G-DCT transmission clutch packs are the primary physical limiting factors.",
