    "engineLifespan": "180 000 - 250 000+ km. While the H5Ht/M282 block is durable, the GLB is a heavy, boxy, 7-seater capable SUV. This extreme weight places immense, constant load on the tiny 1.33L engine, causing the turbo to spool constantly just to maintain highway speeds, which increases thermal stress and slightly reduces the overall lifespan compared to the lighter A-Class or GLA.",
