    "repairCostEstimate": "700 - 1,500 EUR / year (The M282 block itself is mechanically brilliant. However, the risk rating is elevated to a 6/10 for the MHEV GLB specifically. The 48V mild-hybrid system is expensive to fix if it fails outside warranty, and the heavy 7-seater GLB chassis puts immense, constant strain on the tiny 1.33L engine, accelerating turbo and DCT wear. Ensure low-ash oil is used to protect the GPF.)",
