    "engineLifespan": "150 000 - 250 000+ km. While the core aluminum block with CONICSHAPE cylinder honing is incredibly durable, the M260 engine has a notorious, highly documented flaw regarding premature exhaust valve seat wear in the cylinder head, which can drastically cut the engine's lifespan short if not addressed under warranty.",
