    "euroStandard": "Euro 6e",
    "maxPowerStockInternals": "300+ hp. The internal rotating assembly handles Stage 1 and Stage 2 tuning effortlessly. However, tuning mild-hybrid variants is highly complex due to the 48V integration, GPF restrictions, and the thermal limitations of pulling a heavy, unaerodynamic SUV.",
