    "engineLifespan": "150 000 - 250 000+ miles (240 000 - 400 000+ km). The core aluminum block is incredibly durable. However, the USA-spec M260 engine is plagued by the catastrophic exhaust valve seat failure issue, which led to a massive extended warranty program (up to 15 years / 150,000 miles in the US) for cylinder head replacement.",
