    "engineLifespan": "150 000 - 250 000+ km. The core aluminum block featuring CONICSHAPE cylinder honing is incredibly durable. However, the M260 engine has a notorious flaw regarding premature exhaust valve seat wear. In the heavy, boxy GLB chassis, the AMG tuning pushes exhaust gas temperatures to the extreme, exacerbating this specific cylinder head failure.",
    "turboType": "Single Twin-Scroll Turbocharger. The AMG variant utilizes a larger, specifically tuned twin-scroll turbocharger with an electronically controlled wastegate. It provides exceptional throttle response, working overtime to overcome the GLB's significant aerodynamic drag and mass.",
