    "maxPowerStockInternals": "400+ hp. The internal rotating assembly handles Stage 1 and Stage 2 tuning effortlessly. However, tuning mild-hybrid variants is highly complex due to the 48V safety limiters, GPF restrictions, and strict torque limits of the 8G-DCT.",
