    "riskRating": 8,
    "repairCostEstimate": "2,000 - 4,500 EUR / year (The risk rating is heavily elevated due to the notorious M260 cylinder head exhaust valve seat failure, combined with the extreme heat and stress of the AMG tuning pulling a heavy 7-seater SUV, AND the addition of the 48V mild-hybrid system. If the 48V lithium-ion battery or the RSG belt system fails outside of warranty, the repair costs are exorbitant. If the cylinder head has already been replaced with the revised part under warranty, the engine drops to a 6/10 risk.)",
