      "Emissions Countdown Paralysis: The highly complex Euro 6d ECU is unforgiving. If a NOx sensor or AdBlue pump fails, the vehicle is completely immobilized once the dashboard countdown hits zero.",
      "Mechatronic Unit Failure (8G-DCT): Skipping the mandatory transmission fluid changes leads to metallic debris circulating through the delicate solenoids, eventually requiring a complete valve body replacement.",
