    "injectionType": "Common Rail Direct Injection (CRDI). Features a highly advanced Bosch injection system operating at an extreme 2500 Bar. Optimized for Euro 6e compliance. This provides phenomenal fuel atomization and massive torque delivery, but the piezo-solenoid injectors are highly sensitive to fuel quality.",
    "engineLifespan": "300 000 - 500 000+ km. The OM654 is an engineering masterpiece featuring an aluminum block with steel stepped-bowl pistons and NANOSLIDE coating. The block itself is virtually indestructible. Lifespan is dictated entirely by maintaining the highly complex Euro 6e twin-SCR emissions system and proactively preventing coolant-vacuum leaks.",
