    "injectionType": "Multi-Point Port Fuel Injection (MPI). Uses standard solenoid injectors spraying over the intake valves. This architecture inherently washes the valves with fuel, preventing the catastrophic carbon sludge buildup seen in modern direct-injected engines.",
