      "Conductor Plate Complete Failure (7G-Tronic): If the transmission fluid is neglected, the conductor plate fails completely, requiring a highly specialized repair involving virginizing and coding a new plate via STAR diagnostics.",
      "Catalytic Converter Meltdown: Ignoring persistent misfires from dead ignition coils will dump unburned fuel into the exhaust, superheating and melting the highly expensive primary catalytic converters.",
      "Hydrolock via Intake Ingestion: Driving through deep water with the factory low-mounted air intake snorkels will suck water directly into the engine, bending the connecting rods instantly.",
