    "timingType": "Simplex timing chain. Features Variable Valve Timing (VVT) on both intake and exhaust camshafts. The M274 has a notorious vulnerability regarding its intake camshaft adjuster locking pin, which frequently breaks and causes a loud cold-start metallic rattle.",
    "injectionType": "Direct Injection (CGI) via high-pressure piezo injectors operating up to 200 Bar. Lacks port injection, making the intake valves highly susceptible to heavy carbon sludge buildup over time.",
    "engineLifespan": "200 000 - 300 000+ km. Lifespan is strictly dependent on rigorous 10,000 km oil changes. Because the GLC 300 runs the highest factory boost configuration for the M274, the pistons and wrist pins endure more stress, making clean oil absolutely vital.",
    "turboType": "Single IHI Turbocharger with an electronic wastegate. Highly optimized factory mapping provides aggressive boost pressure to reach the 245 hp output, making the GLC 300 genuinely fast.",
