    "engineLifespan": "200 000 - 300 000 km. The mechanical engine block is highly durable thanks to CONICSHAPE cylinder honing. However, the vehicle's lifespan is heavily threatened by the 48V EQ Boost electrical system, which is incredibly expensive to repair when it fails.",
    "turboType": "Single Twin-Scroll Turbocharger. Optimized for the GLC 300's higher 258 hp output. The instant electric torque of the 48V EQ Boost starter-generator completely eliminates turbo lag.",
