    "engineLifespan": "150 000 - 250 000+ km. The 13.5 kWh high-voltage battery degrades much slower than the early 350e, but the internal combustion engine is still the fragile M274. The massive 700 Nm of system torque puts immense physical stress on the engine block and drivetrain.",
    "turboType": "Single IHI Turbocharger with an electronic wastegate. Completely supported by the massive 90 kW electric motor, resulting in violent, instant acceleration from 0 RPM.",
