    "engineLifespan": "250,000 - 350,000+ km. The core M177 engine block with Nanoslide coating is virtually indestructible. Lifespan is highly dependent on monitoring the PCV system to prevent Rear Main Seal (RMS) failure and servicing the AMG driveline.",
