      "MCT Transmission Destruction: The AMG SPEEDSHIFT MCT replaces the torque converter with a wet clutch. Continual aggressive launches will burn the clutch packs, requiring a highly specialized and expensive rebuild.",
      "Dynamic Mount Control Faults: When the active engine mounts fail, they can short out their electrical connectors, triggering suspension and drivetrain faults.",
      "Cylinder Washout via Injector Failure: A stuck-open direct injector will wash the protective oil film off the Nanoslide cylinder walls, causing terminal block damage within minutes.",
      "Engine Wiring Harness Meltdown: The 'Hot-V' turbochargers act as an oven for the engine valley. High mileage causes plastic vacuum lines and wiring insulation to turn brittle and shatter, causing complex electrical faults.",
