    "engineLifespan": "300,000 - 500,000+ km. The heavy cast-iron block and forged rotating assembly are legendary for their brute strength (frequently used in Sprinter vans). However, reaching high mileage requires proactive timing chain replacement and deleting/fixing the oil pump solenoid.",
    "turboType": "Sequential Twin-Turbocharger (BorgWarner R2S). A small high-pressure turbo provides instant response off the line, while a larger low-pressure turbo takes over at higher RPMs. Produces 400 Nm of torque with virtually zero lag.",
