      "AdBlue Tank Heater Failure: The internal heating element in the DEF tank burns out, triggering a Check Engine Light and a no-start countdown.",
      "Turbo Actuator Heat Soak: The electronic actuator mounted on the side of the hot turbocharger cooks itself over time, causing erratic boost and Limp Mode.",
