    "engineLifespan": "200,000 - 300,000+ km for the internal combustion engine. The core aluminum block is highly advanced and fixes the piston-cracking issues of the older M274. However, the true lifespan of the vehicle is dictated by the highly complex 48V electrical system and the Integrated Starter-Generator (ISG).",
