      "On-Board Charger (OBC) Failure: The internal 11 kW AC charger fails, preventing the high-voltage battery from being charged via a wall plug.",
      "HV Battery Cooling Circuit Leaks: The high-voltage battery relies on the A/C refrigerant loop to stay cool. Leaks overheat the battery and trigger hybrid system shutdowns.",
      "Air Suspension Collapse: The extreme weight of the vehicle (nearly 2.4 tons) obliterates the rear air suspension bags and burns out the compressor prematurely.",
      "GPF Clogging: Because the electric motor handles city driving, the petrol engine rarely reaches operating temperature during short trips, leading to blocked Gasoline Particulate Filters.",
