      "OBC / Inverter Death: Failure of the high-voltage power electronics often requires replacing the entire modular unit (4,000 - 6,000 EUR).",
      "Massive Hybrid Motor Labor Cost: The 100 kW electric motor is sandwiched between the engine and the 9G-Tronic transmission. If it fails, the entire transmission must be dropped.",
      "Catastrophic Brake Booster Failure (Coolant Leak): If the ICE coolant shut-off valve fails, coolant floods the vacuum lines. You will lose braking assist suddenly.",
      "Valvetrain Destruction: The ICE is pushed to 252 hp. If the roller rocker arms fail due to excessive cold-starts on thin 0W-20 oil, they will grind the camshaft lobes down to bare metal.",
