    "engineLifespan": "150,000 - 250,000 km. The 'One Man, One Engine' M139l is a racing engine in a street car. It operates at terrifying pressures (up to 2.1 bar of boost). It requires absolutely obsessive, flawless maintenance to survive long-term.",
    "turboType": "Electric Exhaust Gas Turbocharger. Formula 1 derived technology. An electric motor sits directly on the turbo shaft, spinning the compressor wheel before exhaust gases arrive, completely eliminating turbo lag despite the massive size of the turbo.",
