      "48V System Bricking: If the 48V battery or RSG fails, the vehicle becomes completely immobilized.",
      "Spun Bearings (Cold Revving): The forged internals require precise thermal expansion. Revving the engine past 3,000 RPM before oil reaches 90°C will rapidly spin the main bearings and destroy the engine.",
