    "engineLifespan": "250,000 - 350,000+ km for the ICE. The core block is phenomenal, but pushing 269 hp from a 2.0L diesel significantly increases thermal and physical load on the cooling system, turbos, and injectors. Fastidious maintenance is absolutely non-negotiable.",
    "turboType": "Advanced Two-Stage Turbocharging (Biturbo). A smaller high-pressure turbo works at low RPMs, seamlessly transitioning to a larger low-pressure turbo at higher RPMs. Paired with the 48V ISG (+200 Nm), it eradicates lag entirely.",
